  "summary_text": "Check-in with Atlas Manufacturing's Head of Operations on proposal v1. He wants to sign next week, but the CFO, who signs, has not seen the proposal yet. Atlas has 120k USD a year approved for the CRM. Tiago will forward the proposal to the CFO this week; Ana checks in on 12 November.",
  "summary_markdown": "Check-in with Atlas Manufacturing's Head of Operations on proposal v1. He wants to sign next week, but the CFO, who signs, has not seen the proposal yet. Atlas has 120k USD a year approved for the CRM. Tiago will forward the proposal to the CFO this week; Ana checks in on 12 November.",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Hi Tiago, how are you? I wanted to check how the proposal landed.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:09Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:14Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, I love it. Let's sign next week.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:15Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:18Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Great to hear. Has Helena had a chance to look at it?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:22Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:26Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "Not yet. Our CFO, Helena Duarte, hasn't seen the proposal. She signs anything above a hundred thousand. I will forward it to her this week.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:27Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:37Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "I've been pushing for this internally since your demo, and I'll walk Helena through the proposal myself.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:50Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:00:57Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "And you can put it down as a one million dollar deal in your system. It'll make your quarter look great.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:01:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:01:18Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Let's see what Helena says first. Has she raised any concerns on pricing or contract terms so far?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:01:22Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:01:29Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "No, nothing yet. She hasn't seen it.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:01:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:01:33Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "For the record, we have one hundred and twenty thousand dollars a year approved for the CRM in next year's budget.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:13Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "That's useful, thanks. And the scope is still the seventy-five users in the proposal?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:20Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:25Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "Yes, seventy-five users to start, sales and the customer service desk.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:26Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:30Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "Once Helena approves, our legal team needs about two weeks to review the contract, and then she signs.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:45Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:03:52Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "Sorry, my son just texted me, he scored in his football match this morning. Proud dad moment.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:06:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:06:46Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Congratulations to him!",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:06:47Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:06:48Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Next step then: you forward proposal v1 to Helena this week, and I'll check in with you on Thursday the 12th.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:12:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:12:48Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "Deal. Thursday the 12th.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:12:52Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:12:54Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Tiago Mendes"
      },
      "text": "Thanks, Ana. Talk then.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T14:23:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T14:23:07Z"
    }
  ]
}
